# The sdist carries what tests/ reads, so the suite runs from an unpacked sdist:
# tests/data (release fixtures) and the offline proofs, docs/ (the offer JSON and
# the pages whose install commands are checked), the three scripts the tests import
# or run (verify_offer.py and the check_route.py it imports, tunnel_ua_probe.py) -
# the rest of scripts/ is operator tooling and stays repo-only - and .github/ (test_ci_workflow.py
# looks there; with no workflow present its workflow laws skip).
# .ledger/ (operator notes) and audits/ are repo-only and are not shipped.
graft tests
graft docs
include scripts/verify_offer.py scripts/check_route.py scripts/tunnel_ua_probe.py
graft .github
global-exclude __pycache__
global-exclude *.py[cod]
